  - 한글: Pretendard (OFL) / Apple SD Gothic Neo
- **위계**:
  - Display: 56px / 800 / 1.05 / -0.02em
  - H1: 36px / 700 / 1.15 / -0.01em
  - H2: 24px / 700 / 1.25 / 0
  - H3: 18px / 600 / 1.3 / 0
